{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し第４回目。\n皆さん。飽きてきた頃かと思いますが、よろしくお願いいたします。\n生駒頑張って答えます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2778274/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、目標にしている人は？\n誰だろうな〜\nいつか本気で追い越したい人が現れるかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、乃木坂46を一言で言うと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かけがえのない仲間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、生駒ちゃんちにお泊まりしに来たメンバーいる？\nれなりんが来たよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、どうしたら、緊張をほぐせるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは緊張をしないのででも沸き上がる感情などやその状況を楽しめばよいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、サンタって信じる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"信じてたさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、宇宙人いると思う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いるさ、だって地球人いるし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、泳げますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナズチ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、秋田でのライブ実現できたら、その次に目指すものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田で番組を持つこと!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2778274/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、ソロ活動するなら、歌手？女優？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q、お気に入りのドリンクある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炭酸ジュースはほぼ好きね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"、元気の源は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンガ読む、二次元に行くことねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2778274/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと家族と友達!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ!!\nまだ少しあるからもう少し付き合ってくれよな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/02/2778274/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}